genAIService console-genai-primary (
    name: Fusion Console AI Service
    provider: ociGenAI
    endpointUrl {
        url: "https://inference.generativeai.PENDING-REGION.oci.oraclecloud.com"
    }
    authentication {
        credentials: @fusion-ai-console-oci-cred
    }
    appBuilder {
        usedByAppBuilder: true
        defaultForNewApps: false
    }
    advanced {
        modelName: PENDING-PHASE-0-CONFIRM-MODEL
    }
    comments {
        comments:
            ```
            Placeholder pending Phase 0 confirmation of which LLM backend is
            actually provisioned (plan Phase 0). provider defaults to ociGenAI
            per the plan's recommendation - override if a different provider
            is already contracted. endpointUrl region and advanced.modelName
            are not real values - fill in once known, then re-validate.
            ```
    }
)
